{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31752","headline":"送陈商 · 贾岛","name":"送陈商","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古道长荆棘，新岐路交横。\n君於荒榛中，寻得古辙行。\n足踏圣人路，貌端禅士形。\n我曾接夜谈，似听讲一经。\n联翩曾数举，昨登高第名。\n釜底绝烟火，晓行皇帝京。\n上客远府游，主人须目明。\n青云别青山，何日复可升。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}